1
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:08,351
To make your own list, start with a content type, which defines a kind of content.

2
00:00:08,351 --> 00:00:13,000
Open Design, Content Definition, Content Types, and choose Create new type.

3
00:00:13,892 --> 00:00:15,352
Name it Help Center.

4
00:00:15,352 --> 00:00:18,496
The Technical Name fills in from the Display Name.

5
00:00:18,496 --> 00:00:21,192
Create saves the type and opens Add Parts.

6
00:00:22,004 --> 00:00:24,150
Parts give a type its behavior.

7
00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:25,657
Check three of them:

8
00:00:25,657 --> 00:00:30,295
Autoroute gives items a web address, List turns the type into a container,

9
00:00:30,295 --> 00:00:32,324
and Title gives them a title.

10
00:00:32,785 --> 00:00:35,643
Add Selected Parts attaches them and opens the type.

11
00:00:35,643 --> 00:00:37,860
Each part you added has an Edit button.

12
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:40,175
Let's open the settings of the List part.

13
00:00:40,648 --> 00:00:46,717
The settings are Page Size, Enable Ordering, Contained Content Types, Show container's header,

14
00:00:46,717 --> 00:00:48,294
and Show full pager.

15
00:00:48,294 --> 00:00:51,328
A separate video covers ordering and paging.

16
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:54,631
A list needs at least one contained type.

17
00:00:54,631 --> 00:00:59,727
Contained Content Types lists every content type, so check Page, the type this

18
00:00:59,727 --> 00:01:01,790
list holds, and choose Save.

